@startuml ApplicationLayerSequence

participant "EchoClient2" as EchoClient2
participant "EchoClientHelper2" as EchoClientHelper2
participant "EchoServerThread" as EchoServerThread
participant "EchoServer3" as EchoServer3

EchoClient2 -> EchoClientHelper2: sendRequest("LOGIN t00224519 mypassword")
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoServerThread: LOGIN t00224519 mypassword
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Sets isLoggedIn = true
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Adds "anonymous" to userMessages
EchoServerThread -> EchoClientHelper2: 101 LOGIN SUCCESS
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoClient2: Returns "101 LOGIN SUCCESS"

EchoClient2 -> EchoClientHelper2: sendRequest("UPLOAD Hello!")
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoServerThread: UPLOAD Hello!
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Creates Message("d0", "Hello!")
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Adds Message to userMessages["anonymous"]
EchoServerThread -> EchoClientHelper2: 201 UPLOAD SUCCESS (Message ID: d0)
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoClient2: Returns "201 UPLOAD SUCCESS (Message ID: d0)"

EchoClient2 -> EchoClientHelper2: sendRequestMultiLine("DOWNLOAD")
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoServerThread: DOWNLOAD
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Retrieves messages from userMessages["anonymous"]
EchoServerThread -> EchoClientHelper2: 301 MESSAGE (ID: d0): Hello!
EchoServerThread -> EchoClientHelper2: Message Downloaded
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoClient2: Returns messages

EchoClient2 -> EchoClientHelper2: sendRequest("LOGOFF")
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoServerThread: LOGOFF
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Sets isLoggedIn = false
EchoServerThread -> EchoClientHelper2: 401 LOGOFF SUCCESS
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoClient2: Returns "401 LOGOFF SUCCESS"
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoClientHelper2: Calls done() to close connection

@enduml